><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 及序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\">\\([A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard3\\text{-}partition\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3PartitionCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land0&lt;\\lambda\\leq\\kappa\\land0&lt;\\mu\\land0&lt;n&lt;\\omega\\land\\forall c\\in\\mu^{[\\kappa]^n}\\;\\exists H\\in[\\kappa]^\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\bigl|c\\mathbin{``}[H]^n\\bigr|=1\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard3\\text{-}partition\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3PartitionCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land0&lt;\\lambda\\leq\\kappa\\land0&lt;\\mu\\land0&lt;n&lt;\\omega\\land\\forall c\\in\\mu^{[\\kappa]^n}\\;\\exists H\\in[\\kappa]^\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\bigl|c\\mathbin{``}[H]^n\\bigr|=1\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the partition relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\to(\\lambda)^n_\\mu\">\\(\\kappa\\to(\\lambda)^n_\\mu\\)</span>, with every coloring and homogeneous-set witness bound in the assertion.</li>\n<li>The target size and color cardinal are nonzero, excluding vacuous empty-color and impossible empty-homogeneous-set edge cases.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3PartitionCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard3\\text{-}partition\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3PartitionCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land0<\\lambda\\leq\\kappa\\land0<\\mu\\land0<n<\\omega\\land\\forall c\\in\\mu^{[\\kappa]^n}\\;\\exists H\\in[\\kappa]^\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\bigl|c\\mathbin{``}[H]^n\\bigr|=1\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa\\to(\\lambda)^n_\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":1494,"backlinks":[{"i